{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Dozi 是一款睡前與晨間陪伴工具，適合想放慢節奏、整理思緒，並建立安靜睡前儀式的人。它提供可自訂睡前流程、四種引導呼吸節奏、六種平靜聲音循環與自訂混音，亦可匯入或錄製個人音訊，並設有背景播放及睡眠計時。原價 US $2.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460bb-75-172.webp\">\n<h2>溫和聲音與私隱陪伴</h2>\n<p>Dozi 讓你可自訂睡前流程，配合四種引導呼吸節奏，以及雨聲、海浪、風扇、白噪音、森林和壁爐六種聲音循環。你可混合並儲存個人音效，匯入或錄製音訊，使用背景播放與柔和淡出計時。早上可簽到並溫和留意模式，沒有分數或壓力。思緒、錄音、流程與簽到只留在你的裝置，沒有帳戶、廣告、分析或追蹤。Dozi 支援放鬆與建立例行，不提供醫療建議或診斷。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-192-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-193-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-194-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-195-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-196-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-197-scaled.jpg\">\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Dozi – Your Bedtime Companion</li>\n<li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T09:20:55.536745+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":371,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T09:00:22+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T18:38:04.192830+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T09:17:42.252654+00:00","content_hash":"f53af3e2907e8d05352b9610910f11ee750556b849d1ecada7ca104248f12299","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}